      "blocks": {
        "text_j4xMfy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kremp Florist has several popular fundraising programs available for local groups looking to raise money for their important causes.  We make it easy and work with you to make it a success!  From our beautiful mum plants in the fall to gorgeous poinsettias during the Christmas season to premium outdoor plants in the spring, there is always an opportunity right around the corner for you to raise money.  Our personalized service and easy ordering make working with Kremp Florist for your fundraisers and plant sales a breeze!</p><p>Since we deliver 7 days a week to our gigantic delivery area, we can deliver your plants on the day of your choice within a window of time that works best.  Plants are labelled to make it easy and our delivery team can leave the plants in the area that you prefer.</p><p>For some of our plant offerings, we even have a voucher program available.  This is the easiest and most profitable fundraising program available.</p><p>We provide you with vouchers that you sell.<br/>Your customers then bring that voucher to our store where they can hand select whichever plant they like best.This saves you time and money by not having to receive a large delivery of plants, sort them and wait for everyone to come pick them up.Voucher pricing is lower than the normal fundraising prices and there is no delivery charge since everyone picks up their plants.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_j4xMfy"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_position": "justify-center",
        "text_align": "text-start",
        "mob_center_text": true,
        "wide": true,
        "color_scheme": "none",
