          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hardy mum plants - the perfect fall fundraiser",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_KV4w3J": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are proud to offer our own-grown hardy mums for your group to sell.  Available in single pots, hanging baskets and even patio pots!  Our mum plants are the nicest in the area(they really are).  We receive rave reviews each year about how nice the mums are. Colors include red/burgundy, yellow/gold, orange/bronze, white and lavender.</p><p>This program typically runs from late August through mid October.We recommend delivery/pick-up dates by the first week of October.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_hGJtVd",
        "text_KV4w3J"
