      "blocks": {
        "heading_ReYfBf": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Poinsettias & winter wreaths - a great holiday season fundraiser",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_bpnrRR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each holiday season, we offer our own-grown poinsettias in 4 popular sizes that customers love for decorating their homes for the holidays.  Available with or without decorative foil around the base of the pots. Colors include red, white, pink, marble, jingle bell and red/white combo. Sizing ranges from 6+ blooms to 24+ blooms.</p><p>We also have beautiful fresh holiday wreaths that are made with popular winter greens such as balsam, berried juniper, noble fir and incense cedar.  Available with or without red velvet bows.</p><p>This program typically runs from November through Christmas week.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
