          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Spring outdoor plants - a popular school & church fundraiser",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_jN9cb4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>By the time spring comes around, everyone is ecstatic to see our beautiful blooming outdoor plants, welcoming the warmth of the season.  We grow these plants locally and are proud of the incredible quality.  These plants can easily last throughout the summer with proper care. Blooming hanging baskets are the top seller for fundraisers. Gorgeous geraniums and flowering patio pots are also available.</p><p>This program typically runs from April through June.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
