        },
        "text_PiVhNn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kremp Florist is located on Davisville road in Willow Grove, PA.  We have the largest delivery area of any florist in the region servicing all of Philadelphia and the surrouding regions including Montgomery county, Bucks county and Delaware county.  We would love to be a part of your fundraiser.  Please reach out to us here to tell us more about your event, the date and what you are interested in.  We will be sure to get right back to you.</p>",
